OL,3,GNEWSAPerson in hospital following
OL,4,Areported fall at National Trust site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person has suffered "suspected
OL,7,Fserious injuries" following a reported
OL,8,Ffall at a National Trust site on the
OL,9,FCheshire-Staffordshire border.
OL,11,FThe Coastguard helicopter was sent to
OL,12,FMow Cop Castle, between Congleton and
OL,13,FKidsgrove, just after 12:30 GMT.
OL,15,FSearch and rescue teams from Wirral,
OL,16,FSouthport and Crosby also attended,
OL,17,Falongside an air ambulance, following
OL,18,Freports that a person had fallen.
OL,20,FThe incident remains ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
